  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I've been keeping things inside",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Taking up space 'til I got someone",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I could open my mind up to",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I guess it worked pretty good 'til now",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "But shit's kinda getting serious",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I think I'm running out of room",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Everyone's got someone built custom",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "To give their darkness to",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I wish I had someone, could trust 'em",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "But loyalty don't come for free",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "'Cause all my friends are fake, fake, fake, fake",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "They just want me for the day, day, until they don't",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I stay up wondering",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "What if I broke my legs?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "What if I changed my name?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Would you still love me the same?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Or are you just as fake?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Like, all my friends are fake",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Sorry if I got you wrong",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Didn't mean to judge you by a cover",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I've been burnt so many times",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "It's hard to turn it off",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Everyone's got people they see through",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "But I see through everyone",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "So if you want me to believe you and need you",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Might take some time to recognize",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
